<page-meta page-style="{{(modal_locked) ? 'overflow: hidden;' : ''}}" />
<view class="practice-page">
  <scroll-view class="practice-content" scroll-y="true" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false">
    <view class="page-shell">
      <view class="practice-intro">
        <view class="practice-title">自在练习，慢慢积累</view>
        <view class="practice-copy">没有倒计时的压力，按自己的节奏探索</view>
        <view class="practice-meta"><text class="practice-chip">不限时</text><text class="practice-chip">不计分</text></view>
      </view>
      <view class="practice-guide surface">
        <view class="practice-guide-title">练习规则</view>
        <view class="practice-rule"><text class="practice-rule-index">1</text><view class="practice-rule-text">每题不限时，计时但不计分。</view></view>
        <view class="practice-rule"><text class="practice-rule-index">2</text><view class="practice-rule-text">答错的题将计入错题集，但不计入“我的”页面“错题数”等数据。</view></view>
        <view class="practice-rule"><text class="practice-rule-index">3</text><view class="practice-rule-text">每日练习达<text class="hi-num">300</text>题，送<text class="hi-num">10000</text>百科币。</view></view>
        <view class="practice-rule"><text class="practice-rule-index">4</text><view class="practice-rule-text">长按题目可永久跳过，每日限<text class="hi-num">5</text>次机会。</view></view>
        <view class="practice-rule"><text class="practice-rule-index">5</text><view class="practice-rule-text">对题目有任何疑问，欢迎点击左上角按钮进行反馈<text class="common-gray">（作答之后反馈）</text>。</view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="practice-dock">
    <view bindtap="goToTrain" class="train-btn primary-button" hover-class="button-pressed" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80">开始练习</view>
  </view>
</view>
<ui-feedback state="{{ui_feedback}}" />
